# NEXORA — Cyber Intelligence Dashboard

A futuristic, responsive cybersecurity dashboard built with **HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript**. NEXORA features interactive analytics, animated network visualizations, threat intelligence, activity logs, and security reports in a premium dark-themed interface.

> **Note:** This is a frontend demonstration project. All threat records, network activity, security metrics, and monitoring data are simulated and do not represent real-time cybersecurity monitoring.

## Features

- **Interactive Dashboard** — Security statistics, system health indicators, and activity summaries.
- **Threat Intelligence** — Searchable threat records with severity filters and detailed information.
- **Network Monitor** — Animated network visualization and simulated traffic activity.
- **Activity Logs** — Search, filter, sort, and inspect security events.
- **Security Reports** — Generate downloadable CSV reports from demo data.
- **Customizable Settings** — Accent colors, display preferences, and animation controls.
- **Live Clock** — Automatically updating date and time display.
- **Interactive UI** — Navigation, notifications, dropdowns, modal dialogs, and toast messages.
- **Local Preferences** — Save supported settings using browser `localStorage`.
- **Responsive Design** — Layouts adapted for mobile phones, tablets, laptops, and desktop monitors.
- **Accessibility** — Keyboard navigation, visible focus indicators, and reduced-motion support.

## Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| HTML5 | Application structure |
| CSS3 | Styling, animations, and responsive layouts |
| Vanilla JavaScript | Interactions, application logic, and demo data |
| Canvas API / CSS | Interactive visualizations |
