## Usage

1. Open the dashboard to explore security statistics.
2. Navigate between dashboard sections using the sidebar.
3. Search and filter demo threat records and activity logs.
4. Inspect individual events using their detail controls.
5. Explore the animated network visualization.
6. Generate and download a CSV security report.
7. Customize supported display preferences in Settings.

All displayed security activity is simulated for demonstration purposes.

